<title>SPAIN: Spain July M4 rose provisional 15.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain July M4 rose provisional 15.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain gave the following figures:</p>
<p> MONEY SUPPLY		   JULY 97    JUNE 97   JULY 96</p>
<p> M4 pct rise		     15.1	   O.4	 3.6</p>
<p> Domestic credit pct rise    11.0	  11.2	 3.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Percentage monthly rises are on annualised basis. Previous months' figures are revised.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
